# MedSync Health, Inc.
# Job Description: Enterprise Sales Representative

**Location:** Remote (US)

## The Role

We are looking for a quota-carrying Enterprise Sales Representative to join our growing sales team. You will be responsible for selling the MedSync Platform to mid-to-large hospitals and health systems.

## Responsibilities

- Prospect and qualify new leads
- Conduct product demonstrations
- Negotiate and close deals
- Achieve quarterly and annual sales quotas
- Collaborate with customer success to ensure smooth handoffs

## Qualifications

- 5+ years of enterprise software sales experience
- Healthcare industry experience preferred
- Proven track record of exceeding quota
- Bachelor's degree required
